        },
        {
          "text": "Hosa indi, Merari anzipi ma eseliari ovu agianzi be: ambori Simiri’i (eri ka tro ndra ovu mva okori ku ti, kiri ati ’ba eri ovuzu ’ba amboruni), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iriri Hili­kia’i, nari Tebalia’i, suri Zekaria’i: anzi Hosani pi adripi erini be dria mudri drini na. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azi jotile agei tezu amutisiri ovu yini, adani ’ba amboru yi ma eselia nga azi nde amutisini tro tro yi ma adripile, azi ngazu jo Yehovani ma alia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
