        },
        {
          "text": "Azini afa dria Samueli ’ba e’yo ndreza ndrepiri pini, Saulo Kisi mvi pie, Abineri Neri mvi pie, Yoabu Zeruya mvi pie, yini ndra fele Mungu dri ’diyi-ka ndra ’ba ngoni ngoni ti ka afa azini fe Mungu dri, afa ’diri ovu ndra Selo­moti pi ma dri alia adripi erini be. ",
          "type": "text",
